  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb, no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *quemado* (regular)",
    "Often used reflexively: *quemarse* — *me he quemado la espalda* (I have burned my back), *me quemé con el café* (I burned myself on the coffee)",
